  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/03/DSCF1155.jpg\" style=\"height: 360px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>En los campos de la Caja Rural de Onda se ha celebrado este domingo la IV Prueba puntuable de silvestrismo de regularidad de la Comunitat Valenciana, para todas las variedades de p&aacute;jaros,&nbsp;organizada por la&nbsp;Sociedad Ornitol&oacute;gica Sant&iacute;simo Salvador.</p>\n<p><br />\n &nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1155.jpg\" alt=\"dscf1155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1156.jpg\" alt=\"dscf1156\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1157.jpg\" alt=\"dscf1157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1158.jpg\" alt=\"dscf1158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1159.jpg\" alt=\"dscf1159\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1160.jpg\" alt=\"dscf1160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1161.jpg\" alt=\"dscf1161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1162.jpg\" alt=\"dscf1162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismepardaletscaixarural/dscf1163.jpg\" alt=\"